        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "To a stirred colorless MeCN solution of mosaoH2, [Mn3O(piv)6(py)3] and Ln(NO3)3·6H2O (Ln = Dy) were added N-mdeaH2 and NEt3. The resulting brown solution was stirred for 5 minutes and filtered. The filtrate was left undisturbed at room temperature for three days to deposit prismatic black crystals of 1.",
